WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:14.517
It was a spring morning.

2
00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:17.357
A woman was driving to work.

3
00:00:17.357 --> 00:00:20.457
"I hope I'm not late," she said.

4
00:00:20.457 --> 00:00:24.265
"I don't want to be fired!"

5
00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:27.638
The woman parked her car outside a construction site.

6
00:00:27.639 --> 00:00:30.388
She ran toward the gate.

7
00:00:30.388 --> 00:00:33.056
"Oh no!" said the woman.

8
00:00:33.056 --> 00:00:37.087
"I left my lunch in the car!"

9
00:00:37.087 --> 00:00:39.371
Suddenly the ground rumbled!

10
00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:44.536
A hole appeared, and the car began to sink!

11
00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:50.826
The woman gasped. "My car!"

12
00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:54.927
Roxy and her friends were walking to soccer practice.

13
00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:58.241
"I love spring," said Jack.

14
00:00:58.241 --> 00:01:01.919
"That's because you love soccer," said Mara.

15
00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:06.029
Jack grinned. "I just like playing outside."

16
00:01:06.029 --> 00:01:10.116
"Who doesn't like playing outside?" Terrell asked.

17
00:01:10.116 --> 00:01:14.623
"I bet Rocket Girl is an awesome soccer player," said Jack.

18
00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:17.948
"Nobody could beat her," said Terrell.

19
00:01:17.948 --> 00:01:23.470
Mara smiled. "She could score even while playing goalie!"

20
00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:26.874
Terrell pretended to kick a ball.

21
00:01:26.874 --> 00:01:30.636
"She could kick the ball past everyone."

22
00:01:30.636 --> 00:01:34.618
"Down the whole field!" said Jack.

23
00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:39.415
"It wouldn't be fair for Rocket Girl to play," said Roxy.

24
00:01:39.415 --> 00:01:44.782
"She has super powers. Would you want to play against her?"

25
00:01:44.782 --> 00:01:49.692
"Rocket Girl would be on our team!" said Terrell.

26
00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:53.906
The four friends arrived at the school's soccer field.

27
00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:56.718
"Sorry, kids," Coach Nicole called out.

28
00:01:56.718 --> 00:02:00.332
She looked upset. "No practice today."

29
00:02:00.332 --> 00:02:03.108
Jack frowned. "Why not?"

30
00:02:03.109 --> 00:02:07.101
"It's so strange," Coach Nicole said, pointing behind her.

31
00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:12.394
"The equipment shed is missing. And all our soccer balls were inside."

32
00:02:12.394 --> 00:02:14.697
"Huh?" said Terrell.

33
00:02:14.698 --> 00:02:18.845
Roxy and her friends looked at the spot where the coach was pointing.

34
00:02:18.845 --> 00:02:20.924
"Whoa!" said Jack.

35
00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:23.905
"There's a big hole in the ground!"

36
00:02:23.905 --> 00:02:26.794
"It's a sinkhole," said the coach.

37
00:02:26.794 --> 00:02:29.802
"I guess the shed fell into it."

38
00:02:29.802 --> 00:02:35.842
Mara sighed. "Is there any way to get the shed back out?"

39
00:02:35.842 --> 00:02:39.068
"Rocket Girl could do it," said Terrell.

40
00:02:39.068 --> 00:02:43.897
"I think Rocket Girl has more important things to do," said Roxy.

41
00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:48.468
"She can't spend all day looking for the sinking shed."

42
00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:54.478
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

43
00:02:54.478 --> 00:03:01.103
She moved away from her friends and pressed a button.

44
00:03:01.104 --> 00:03:04.315
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

45
00:03:04.315 --> 00:03:08.088
"Sinkholes are appearing all over Metro City!"

46
00:03:08.089 --> 00:03:11.944
"A sinkhole appeared at the soccer field too," said Roxy.

47
00:03:11.944 --> 00:03:14.992
"The equipment shed sank into it."

48
00:03:14.992 --> 00:03:17.966
"You must do something," said the mayor.

49
00:03:17.966 --> 00:03:22.054
"All the vehicles at the new construction site are gone!"

50
00:03:22.054 --> 00:03:24.621
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

51
00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:29.857
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
